          <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    New Products\n                    <span class=\"count\">8</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/ml-intern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ml-intern</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Hugging Face's open-source ML engineer that reads papers, trains models, and ships ML models - an AI agent that automates the entire machine learning workflow from research to production.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"2,985 stars today - highest engagement among AI coding tools\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">free-claude-code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Use claude-code for free in the terminal, VSCode extension or via discord - makes Anthropic's Claude Code CLI accessible without subscription, similar to openclaw.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"2,638 stars today - democratizes access to Claude Code CLI\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/zilliztech/claude-context\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">claude-context</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Code search MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for Claude Code that makes entire codebases searchable as context - solves the context window limitation for AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"706 stars - addresses critical context window problem\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/vibearound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VibeAround</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Chat with your local AI coding agent from any IM or browser - brings AI coding assistance to your existing communication tools without switching contexts.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/kimiflare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kimiflare</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Kimi K2.6 CLI code editor hosted on Cloudflare Workers AI - serverless AI code editing environment leveraging Cloudflare's edge computing and Kimi's K2.6 model.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/wrangle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wrangle</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        The markdown editor that understands CLAUDE.md - first markdown editor with native support for Anthropic's CLAUDE.md specification for AI project documentation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/seeknal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seeknal</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Data & AI/ML CLI for pipelines and natural language queries - command-line tool for building data pipelines and querying them using natural language.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/eol-dataset\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EOL Dataset</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Find every EOL (end-of-life) dependency in your stack in 5 minutes for free - workflow-specific developer tool for dependency management and security auditing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific tool</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35% width) -->\n            <section class=\"section whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Whitelist Updates\n                    <span class=\"count\">1</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Continue</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span> Added support for Inception Labs' mercury-2 model, expanding the available AI models for code autocomplete and chat features in the IDE extension.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">📅 April 17, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/commit/cb273098d968906d25ee737b454f0b5f13ea2482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">View Commit →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25% width) -->\n            <section class=\"section technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Technical Insights\n                    <span class=\"count\">13</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/24/deepseek-v4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DeepSeek V4 Analysis</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Chinese AI lab DeepSeek released frontier-level models at lower price points.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/24/openai-gpt-5-5-release/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GPT-5.5 Released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>OpenAI's \"smartest and most intuitive\" model yet, continuing push toward AI super app.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Lucas Ropek</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">OpenAI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">GPT-5.5</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/24/google-anthropic-investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google's $10B Anthropic Investment</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>$10B initially, potential for $30B more. Amazon also invested $5B with potential for $20B more.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Jay Peters</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">investment</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/23/claude-code-quality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Postmortem</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>Quality issues caused by harness bugs, not models. Key bug caused older thinking to be cleared from idle sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">bugs</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/qwen3-6-27b/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Qwen3.6-27B Performance</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Flagship-level agentic coding in 27B model, surpasses previous 397B MoE. 55.6GB vs 807GB.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Qwen</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">local models</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/firefox-mythos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firefox 150 + Claude Mythos</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>271 vulnerability fixes from Claude Mythos Preview. \"Every bit as capable\" as top security researchers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">security</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/github-copilot-pricing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Copilot Pricing Changes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>Agentic workflows fundamentally changed compute demands. Long-running parallelized sessions consuming far more resources.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">GitHub Copilot</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/google-ai-generated-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google: 75% AI-Generated Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Up from 50% last fall. Google created \"strike team\" to catch up to Anthropic (70-90% with Claude Code).\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Stevie Bonifield</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/anthropic-mythos-breach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic Mythos Breach</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Unauthorized group gained access to exclusive cyber tool Mythos. Described as \"humiliating\" breach.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">The Verge</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">security</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/21/spacex-cursor-acquisition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SpaceX → Cursor $60B</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>SpaceX working with Cursor, option to buy for $60B. Shows massive valuations for AI coding tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Elizabeth Lopatto</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">SpaceX</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Cursor</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/20/claude-token-counter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Token Counter Update</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Opus 4.7 uses new tokenizer. 1.0-1.35x increase, system prompts 1.46x increase. 40% more expensive.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/19/headless-everything/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Headless Services Future</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>API-first services becoming more common as personal AIs prefer APIs over GUIs. APIs ready for comeback.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">APIs</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/18/claude-opus-system-prompts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Opus System Prompts</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>Analysis of differences between Claude Opus 4.6 and 4.7 system prompts. Only major lab to publish them.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-item\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">system prompts</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>\n            <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">Generated by AgentDaily Research • 2026-04-25</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
